---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="隱私權政策 / Privacy Policy" description="Jacob Mei YouTube 工具的隱私權政策。">
  <article class="article-layout">
    <div class="article-main">
      <h1 class="section-title">隱私權政策</h1>
      <div class="article-content">
        <p>最後更新：2026-11-23</p>

        <h2>這是什麼程式</h2>
        <p>「Jacob Mei YouTube 工具」是梅驊（Jacob Mei）自己使用的影片上架工具，只用來管理他本人擁有的 YouTube 頻道，不對外提供服務，也沒有其他使用者。</p>

        <h2>會存取哪些資料</h2>
        <p>經頻道擁有者授權後，透過 YouTube API Services 存取：</p>
        <ul>
          <li>頻道基本資料（名稱、ID、訂閱數）</li>
          <li>上傳影片，修改標題、說明、縮圖、播放清單與公開狀態</li>
          <li>頻道的觀看與觀眾留存統計（YouTube Analytics，唯讀）</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>資料怎麼用</h2>
        <p>只用於上傳與管理自己頻道的影片，以及查看自己頻道的成效。不用於廣告，不出售，也不分享給任何第三方。</p>

        <h2>資料存在哪裡</h2>
        <p>授權權杖和查詢結果只存在擁有者自己的電腦上。沒有伺服器，也不會傳送到 Google 以外的地方。</p>

        <h2>撤銷授權</h2>
        <p>隨時可以到 Google 帳戶的<a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">第三方存取權</a>頁面移除這個程式的存取權。</p>

        <h2>相關條款</h2>
        <p>本程式使用 YouTube API Services。使用時適用 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube 服務條款</a>與 <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google 隱私權政策</a>。本程式對 Google 使用者資料的使用遵守 <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>，包含其中的 Limited Use（有限使用）規定。</p>

        <h2>聯絡方式</h2>
        <p><a href="mailto:sitedirector@gmail.com">sitedirector@gmail.com</a></p>

        <hr />

        <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: 2026-11-23</p>

        <h2>About this app</h2>
        <p>"Jacob Mei YouTube Tools" is a personal video publishing tool used only by Jacob Mei to manage the YouTube channels he owns. It is not offered to anyone else and has no other users.</p>

        <h2>Data accessed</h2>
        <p>With the channel owner's authorization, the app uses YouTube API Services to access:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Basic channel information (name, ID, subscriber count)</li>
          <li>Video uploads, and edits to titles, descriptions, thumbnails, playlists and privacy status</li>
          <li>The channel's view and audience retention statistics (YouTube Analytics, read-only)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How data is used</h2>
        <p>Only to upload and manage videos on the owner's own channels and to review those channels' performance. Data is not used for advertising, not sold, and not shared with any third party.</p>

        <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
        <p>Authorization tokens and query results are stored only on the owner's own computer. There is no server, and nothing is sent anywhere other than Google.</p>

        <h2>Revoking access</h2>
        <p>You can remove this app's access at any time from your Google Account's <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">third-party access</a> page.</p>

        <h2>Related terms</h2>
        <p>This app uses YouTube API Services. By using it you agree to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube Terms of Service</a>, and the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a> applies. The app's use of Google user data complies with the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p><a href="mailto:sitedirector@gmail.com">sitedirector@gmail.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
